Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:09:00.24,Comment,,0,0,0,,宮內廳：處理日本皇室成員事務的部門
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,這什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我也打不中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才那樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,對 近身絕對能打中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,對我來說太難了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,這命中率無法自保
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在店下面建射擊場
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你瘋了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然隔音處理開支不少
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但工作需要平時的鑽研
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,厲害啊瀧奈 宛如機械般精準
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼擅長實彈肯定能避開要害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.98,0:00:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,沒必要非得用老師的子彈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我們工作不就是直擊要害來著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,已經變了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.47,0:02:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.47,0:02:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你也太認真了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但看到這名字就火大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 瀧奈來得好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.01,0:02:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,試試這個 試試這個
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好真實啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.27,0:03:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,來拿著這個
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.17,0:03:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,替我復仇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,開始
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不好 要撞上了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.71,0:03:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不至於吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,行動模式突然像換了個人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,下把我來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,前輩 玩遊戲太認真了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.15,0:03:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,看這名字就火大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,胡桃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.87,0:04:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,見過瀧奈的內褲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能見過
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是對什麼都好奇嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真空派嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.55,0:04:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那穿什麼不是她的自由嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,內褲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不是這回事 這不是男用的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是指定的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,指定的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,告訴我怎麼回事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我說店裡提供制服但是內衣要自備
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.31,0:04:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但我也不知道穿什麼內衣好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那為什麼是平角內褲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那是店長說的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她不是問我喜好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你笨嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.19,0:04:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,這穿起來還挺舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不是這個問題
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 明天12點在車站集合
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.21,0:04:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有工作嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 是內褲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,明天去買
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 別穿制服來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,穿私服哦 私服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有指定的私服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哦哦 真少見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.66,0:05:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙帶槍了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不能帶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可別拿出來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,千束那裝束是自己弄的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.28,0:05:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不是裝束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.26,0:05:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你都沒有裙子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,只有制服是裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一般都這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.77,0:05:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,對於Lycoris可能是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,去買吧 絕對很合身
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是很懂 如果你幫我選的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 興致來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.18,0:06:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,武器市場無變化啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你看不出來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,泡澡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 還上著班呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,武器市場無變化說明什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.49,0:06:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,說明沒流入黑市
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,看來這條線索不通了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.87,0:06:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,偷了千把槍想幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,人只有兩隻手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有沒有500個士兵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,軍隊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.09,0:06:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,這DA不可能找不到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你倆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.65,0:06:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,來了來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.35,0:06:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你也快換衣服去幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她倆晚上才回來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.39,0:06:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哪件好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,試試這個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.21,0:06:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,棒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:06:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,超可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.35,0:07:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 你有唇膏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多該切入主題了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 買內衣來著
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,怎樣 有喜歡的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,非得要挑個喜歡的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,想要個方便工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,槍戰用的內衣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那種東西不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,穿的這個就挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,既透氣又方便行動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是店長看中的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不 老師怎麼可能想那麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,再說平角內褲怎麼能讓別人看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,內褲是讓人看的衣物嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,萬一走光了怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.51,0:07:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,萬一是什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.15,0:07:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,誰知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.15,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看看是不是適合讓人看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.59,0:08:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,並不是說這種適合我對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.19,0:08:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊 我為什麼要給你看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣就和平角內褲永別了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,男用內褲我會全部處理掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好了接下來是我迫不及待的甜點時間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我們已經完成目標了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼完成 這又不是工作
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就陪我逛逛嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,樹莓希臘優格里科塔荷蘭寶貝鬆餅和
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,全穀物蜂巢奶油加薑片
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,聽名字就是高熱量食物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.95,0:08:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,敗興的話不要講
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,女性對甜品的貪婪是合理的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.19,0:08:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,食堂的飯菜也挺好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:09:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那個總廚好像原本是宮內廳的總廚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,很厲害嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.34,0:09:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,當然厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但是不給做甜品啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,永遠都只有花林糖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜歡吃那個花林糖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是因為你最近才轉來的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,吃個十年就膩歪了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好精緻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這是碳水炸彈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,人生吃飯的次數是有限的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.89,0:09:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,每頓飯都要美味愉悅幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然好吃但是多餘的脂肪對於Lycoris來說是累贅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,再跑步減掉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,這美味值得我這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快快 瀧奈也吃呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.09,0:09:41.67,Top,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.09,0:09:41.67,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\b1\fs50\bord2.5\pos(960,76)}Mince
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.15,0:09:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有照片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.15,0:09:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\b1\fs50\bord3\pos(960,979)}Y a pas de photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,再叫服務員吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\pos(960,979)\b1\fs50\bord3}On appelle un serveur?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我們怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\pos(960,979)\b1\fs50\bord3}Comment on dit dejà?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,多謝款待？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\fnFOT-NewRodin ProN DB\pos(928.671,979)}ごちそうさま
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\pos(960,979)\b1\fs50\bord3}Un problème?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.77,0:09:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,需要幫忙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.77,0:09:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\pos(960,979)\b1\fs50\bord3}Je peux vous aider?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你會說法語嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\pos(960,979)\b1\fs50\bord3}Vous parlez français?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,會一點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\pos(960,979)\b1\fs50\bord3}Un petit peu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\pos(960,979)\b1\fs50\bord3}On est sauvès!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.21,0:10:00.97,Top,,0,0,0,,招牌照片上的鬆餅是哪一個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.21,0:10:00.97,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\b1\fs50\bord3\pos(960,76)}Les pancakes en photo à l'entrèe ce sont lesquels?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真香
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:02.86,Top,,0,0,0,,是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:02.86,Top,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\pos(960,76)\b1\fs50\bord2.5}Ah, celui-ci
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.86,0:10:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,還有這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.86,0:10:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\pos(960,979)\b1\fs50\bord3}et celui-là!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我們點了這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAvenir Next W1G\pos(960,979)\b1\fs50\bord3}Nous on a pris celui-là.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,吃完去個好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,主犯是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好地方就是這嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,這挺漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.39,0:11:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,經常來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,年票
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.27,0:11:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,喜歡的話你也辦張吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.41,0:11:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,這居然是魚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真假
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,這原來是魚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,變成這種形態存在某種合理性嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,合理性？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.54,0:11:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有原因
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是魚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.29,0:11:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,模仿花園鰻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大庭廣眾下避免顯眼的行動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,還不是因為我們是Lycoris
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.11,0:12:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不穿制服就不是Lycoris
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊 好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好帥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.09,0:12:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.87,0:12:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你什麼時候開始用那子彈的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼突然問這個
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,舊電視塔的時候用了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那時拜託老師製作的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.17,0:12:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,有什麼原因嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.27,0:12:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 對我感興趣了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.86,0:12:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,比海馬更感興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.92,0:12:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,比花園鰻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.55,0:12:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因為不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,掠奪了他人的時間使我不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不舒服？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.91,0:12:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是壞人造成的會更不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以打倒而不致死
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不過被打到好痛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.09,0:12:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定死了更舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼啊 很怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我以為會有更博愛的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:12:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,千束渾身是謎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,神秘少女
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.41,0:13:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎 我那麼有魅力嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但沒有那麼複雜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.21,0:13:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,最優先做想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,虧你能記住
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,離開DA也是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,如果只是不殺人在DA也能做到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那也是嗎 全都僅是因為想做嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,尋人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.27,0:13:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我有個想見的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,對我很重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我想找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.72,0:13:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,知道這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,確實一模一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.31,0:13:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什麼才能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.93,0:13:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看不出來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道肯定不是這方面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道自己的才能嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,要是真有就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.10,0:14:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.89,0:14:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以找到這個人了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,沒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.11,0:14:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,十年都沒找到？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.38,0:14:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可能找不到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想說聲謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.42,0:14:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,魚魚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,魚魚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.55,0:14:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,花園鰻
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那個沒必要藏著
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.78,0:14:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,超可愛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.24,0:15:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,走 去企鵝島了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.94,0:15:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,企鵝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,想見見三賀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,別鬧了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,見千束吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,看來不記得我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她只見過你一面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.74,0:15:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,無可奈何
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.49,0:15:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,伸二 你為什麼不說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,千束一直在找你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,亞倫機關禁止與被助人接觸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.61,0:15:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不是說過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,自相矛盾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.02,0:15:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那你也不該出現在店裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.84,0:15:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你讓我消失？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不是這意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,遵守約定了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,天才是上帝的恩賜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要將其恩澤世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,稀世的 殺戮天才
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,聞到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.33,0:16:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,被漂白 被消毒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,健康而不健全的謊言味道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要找回平衡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:16:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Lycoris
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:11.98,Top,,0,0,0,,東武線南栗橋方向直達特快即將到站二號月台
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.49,0:17:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,來了喲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,開工 開工
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,開工
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:17:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,完蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊 是你們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,出什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.46,0:18:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,穿私服掏槍會被警察抓的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不說了不穿制服便不是Lycoris
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.41,0:18:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看 還有那麼多戰利品呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.17,0:19:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,今日午後東京北押上站
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:15.53,Top,,0,0,0,,發生地鐵相撞脫軌事故
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好 到頭了所以是七張
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,又是胡桃得分最高嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.91,0:19:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,胡桃好強啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.53,0:19:19.65,Top,,0,0,0,,據警方回應 脫軌車輛為自動駕駛的回收車
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:21.40,Top,,0,0,0,,無人員傷亡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:26.64,Top,,0,0,0,,現在多數線路仍未恢復運營
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.89,0:19:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,脫軌？ 我都不敢坐地鐵了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:27.89,Top,,0,0,0,,請看現場發來的報導
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.14,0:19:30.85,Top,,0,0,0,,我現在在北押上站口
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.14,0:19:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好是回收車 不幸中的萬幸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:34.57,Top,,0,0,0,,車站入口被封鎖禁止入內
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.53,0:19:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀 千束好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:36.84,Top,,0,0,0,,無法進入事故現場
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:41.57,Top,,0,0,0,,車站門口依然聚集了大量乘客
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.02,0:19:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.49,0:19:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 那是阿部
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.65,0:19:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,阿部上電視了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在工作嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看樣今天他來不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼連警察都不能入場呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.45,0:19:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,還有 為什麼連一個目擊證人都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.14,0:20:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,事情複雜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好扔了 扔了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,這個也扔了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,扔了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,扔…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,穿的這個就挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,既透氣又方便行動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.53,0:20:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,這真是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,千束別摸魚了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 這是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,厚顏無恥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.84,0:20:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在男人家過的夜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.49,0:20:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你是來羞辱我的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:46.10,Top,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你個小屁孩都學壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:48.08,Top,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.74,0:20:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是瀧奈的 是瀧奈的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.47,0:20:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.16,0:21:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所以說那是昨天剛買的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,諸位 我們店裡有位說謊的叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,住口住口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,請過目
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.25,0:21:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.43,0:21:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快點坦白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,殺了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,來 瀧奈用扇子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.58,0:21:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,上次的槍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,各位看見了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.27,0:21:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,男士內褲哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 都說了是瀧奈的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,老師指使的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,大叔的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.69,0:21:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 跳進黃河洗不清了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.91,0:21:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,都說不是了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.97,0:23:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.23,0:23:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,又只剩我一個了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人就是破壞日本平衡的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.56,0:23:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 事故
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.30,0:23:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,事故 事故 事故
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.95,0:23:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.04,0:23:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Lycoris的訊息被封鎖了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在你手上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.73,0:23:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.96,0:23:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是真島吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.76,0:23:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Robota
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.88,0:23:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是可以幫助你的世界第一駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.92,0:23:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,要打倒Lycoris需要我的智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.81,0:23:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我的智慧和你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.20,0:23:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,掛了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.31,0:23:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我搞點他們糊弄不過去的大事就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.99,0:23:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好 開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:48.20,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}君が持ってきた漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:51.20,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}くれた知らない名前のお花
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:53.83,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今日はまだ来ないかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.96,0:21:57.21,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}初めての感情知ってしまった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:22:03.13,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}窓に飾った絵画をなぞってひとりで宇宙を旅して
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.26,0:22:08.47,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}それだけでいいはずだったのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.47,0:22:14.81,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君の手を握ってしまったら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.14,0:22:21.02,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}孤独を知らないこの街には
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.02,0:22:31.78,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}もう二度と帰ってくることはできないのでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.08,0:22:43.17,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君が手を差し伸べた　光で影が生まれる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:49.01,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}歌って聞かせてこの話の続き
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.01,0:22:58.02,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}連れて行って見たことない星まで
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:48.20,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}你送我的漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:51.20,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}和不知名的花
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:53.83,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今天還沒來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.96,0:21:57.21,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}這種感情初次體驗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:22:03.13,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在窗上臨摹塗鴉  獨自前往星辰大海
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.26,0:22:08.47,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}我本該心滿意足
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.47,0:22:14.81,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}直到握住你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.14,0:22:21.02,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在這不懂孤獨的街道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.02,0:22:31.78,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}已經再也回不到從前了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.08,0:22:43.17,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}你伸出了手  光影伴生
